{"id":"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7","group":"90","path":"90/90-cor-henkin-provable.md","title":"Henkin Sentence is Provable","display":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence is Provable","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-cor-henkin-provable","aliases":["90-cor-henkin-provable"],"display":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence is Provable","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-henkin-sentence]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]","[[90-lem-lob]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-cor-henkin-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-cor-henkin-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence is Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4cc1405929acfc1\" href=\"?note=c4cc1405929acfc1\" title=\"90-df-henkin-sentence\">90-df-henkin-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" href=\"?note=f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" title=\"90-lem-lob\">90-lem-lob</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c4cc1405929acfc1\" href=\"?note=c4cc1405929acfc1\" title=\"90-df-henkin-sentence\">90-df-henkin-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,T\">\\(S,g,d,T\\)</span> 为同一编码环境。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_T(\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span> 的原接口现由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a> 独立定义；它不是藏在某个蕴涵前件中的临时等价式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\land\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H)\\land\n\\mathrm{HBL}_T(\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\land\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H)\\land\n\\mathrm{HBL}_T(\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>Henkin 等价给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(H)})\\to H\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(H)})\\to H\\)</span>。对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" href=\"?note=f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" title=\"90-lem-lob\">90-lem-lob</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 Henkin 句子谓词和 HBL 调用名。补出所用 Löb 推理对辅助固定点的需要，不从无约束的“自称可证”直接推出可证性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"c4cc1405929acfc1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-lob","status":"resolved","id":"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-lob]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"c4cc1405929acfc1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":