}_T(P)$。$P$ 可以是已选定的 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$，但不能从该名称推定以下条件成立。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-cor-creative-not-recursive.md]]\n[[90-cor-godel-sound.md]]\n[[90-cor-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[90-cor-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative.md]]\n[[90-cor-liar-independent.md]]"}],"outgoing":["00ee901093c12d44","c4cc1405929acfc1","8c071ce52fa72de0","f57084ad3c1a7029","8d9c15743f7342d2","f9a3c4a1ebd2b711"]}